RQ2. Can AI agents reliably detect and respond to learner misconceptions?

RQ3. Does Knowledge Seeding increase the diversity and depth of learner curiosity?

RQ4. Can personalized pacing improve mastery without reducing foundational knowledge?

RQ5. Can teachers effectively manage large populations of AI-mediated individual learning processes?

RQ6. Can multi-LLM orchestration outperform single-model educational architectures under controlled conditions?

RQ7. What governance architecture is necessary for responsible deployment involving minors?

RQ8. Can such infrastructure remain economically sustainable while protecting learner privacy?

RQ9. How does agentic education affect teacher workload?

