· To teacher?
· To parent?
· To auditor?

F.1.5 Override

Can humans intervene?

· Teacher override?
· Learner refusal?
· Parent objection?
· Institutional stop?

F.1.6 Equity

Are outcomes fairly distributed?

· Across socio-economic groups?
· Across languages?
· Across genders?
· Across abilities?

F.1.7 Protection

Are children protected from harm?

· Content safety?
· Interaction safety?
· Data safety?
· Psychological safety?

F.1.8 Accountability

Who is responsible?

· For pedagogical outcomes?
· For technical failures?
· For ethical breaches?
· For data misuse?

F.1.9 Reversibility

Can the system be stopped?

· At learner level?
· At class level?
· At school level?
· At system level?

