APPENDIX J — MULTI-LLM ROUTING SPECIFICATION

J.1 Routing Objective

\text{Model}^* = \arg\max_{m \in \mathcal{M}} \text{ModelScore}(m, \text{task}, \text{context})

J.2 ModelScore Components

\text{ModelScore} = w_1 Q + w_2 S + w_3 L + w_4 C + w_5 P + w_6 Ln

Where:

· Q — Quality (accuracy, pedagogical appropriateness)
· S — Safety (content safety, child protection)
· L — Latency
· C — Cost
· P — Privacy (data handling)
· Ln — Language coverage

